  "decisions": [
    "Keep the contentless positional kind FTS index unchanged.",
    "Persist full case-exact term keys in SQLite B-trees with per-file/kind delta-varint segments; no hash collisions.",
    "Use distinct-term regex hit relations and literal seeks, with kind domains pushed into posting access.",
    "Keep coverage and exact unindexed ordinals, with bounded residue and source confirmation.",
    "Persist typed decoded properties and offsets in SQL; retain no interior source-text cache.",
    "Hoist an existing universal property demand and mark completed files. Sparse demand remains sparse.",
    "Keep source materializations needed for cache-fill and consumer dependencies; rejecting their blanket removal.",
    "Use bounded record/span transport blocks and the standard series table; no optional runtime backend."
  ],
